rue" class="h-4 w-4" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.788 3.21c.448-1.077 1.976-1.077 2.424 0l2.082 5.006 5.404.434c1.164.093 1.636 1.545.749 2.305l-4.117 3.527 1.257 5.273c.271 1.136-.964 2.033-1.96 1.425L12 18.354 7.373 21.18c-.996.608-2.231-.29-1.96-1.425l1.257-5.273-4.117-3.527c-.887-.76-.415-2.212.749-2.305l5.404-.434 2.082-5.005Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><p class="leading-none">Rated <span class="font-bold">5.0 stars</span></p></div></div><form class="flex w-full max-w-lg flex-1 flex-col rounded-lg bg-white pt-0 sm:border sm:p-8 sm:shadow-lg"><label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase" for="name">Full Name</label><input type="text" class="w-full rounded-md border border-neutral-200 py-1 font-medium text-neutral-950 placeholder:text-neutral-500 mt-2 h-12 px-4" autoComplete="off" id="name" required="" placeholder="John Doe" autoCapitalize="words" autoCorrect="off" name="name" value="Paul Graham"/><label class="mt-3 block text-xs font-bold uppercase" for="domain">Company</label><div class="relative rounded-md bg-white font-medium text-neutral-950 ring-1 ring-inset ring-neutral-200 mt-2"><input class="hidden" readOnly="" name="domain" value="ycombinator.com"/><input type="text" class="w-full rounded-md border py-1 font-medium text-neutral-950 placeholder:text-neutral-500 pointer-events-auto relative border-transparent bg-transparent h-12 px-4 opacity-0" autoComplete="off" id="domain" required="" placeholder="Example (example.com)" autoCorrect="off" value="ycombinator.com"/><div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 flex w-full items-center justify-start overflow-hidden py-1 text-left h-12 px-4"><div class="flex flex-row items-center justify-center gap-2"><img src="/api/favicons/ycombinator.com" alt="ycombinator.com" class="h-5 w-5 flex-none"/><p class="w-full overflow-hidden overflow-ellipsis text-nowrap">Y Combinator<!-- --> <span class="text-neutral-500">(<!-- -->ycombinator.com<!-- -->)</span></p></div></div></div><button class="cursor-pointer overflow-hidden relative appearance-none inline-flex gap-1.5 text-center items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-neutral-900 aria-disabled:pointer-events-none aria-disabled:opacity-50 aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-neutral-100 text-black hover:bg-neutral-200 px-5 mt-6 h-11 w-full text-[1.0625rem]" type="submit">Find email address</button><div></div></form></div></div></section><section class="my-16 w-full bg-neutral-50 py-10"><div class="container"><div class="mx-auto my-20 flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col-reverse gap-8 md:flex-row"><div class="flex-1 basis-1/2 lg:pr-8"><img alt="Finding B2B emails in real-time" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="700" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-3xl" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fuvp-1.de05c0ce.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fuvp-1.de05c0ce.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fuvp-1.de05c0ce.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="flex flex-1 basis-1/2 flex-col md:items-start"><h2 class="text-pretty text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-5xl"><span class="bg-primary-200/35 px-1">Verified emails</span> <!-- -->checked instantly in real-time</h2><p class="mt-6 text-pretty text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-neutral-900">Search for contact details in seconds using our proprietary algorithms and artificial intelligence. We guarantee email data that always remains fresh, accurate and up-to-date.</p><div class="mt-6 flex flex-col items-start justify-start gap-x-3 gap-y-1 font-medium text-neutral-700 lg:flex-row"><div class="flex flex-row items-center justify-center gap-1"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Maximum accuracy</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center justify-center gap-1"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Real-time confirmation</div></div><div class="mt-8 flex flex-col rounded-lg rounded-tl-none bg-neutral-100 p-8"><p class="text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-neutral-900">“I used Getinbox to exceed my targets this quarter. The accurate emails mean fewer bounces and more conversations. It&#x27;s been key to my lead generation.”</p><div class="mt-6 flex flex-row items-start justify-start gap-3"><img alt="Annabelle" loading="lazy" width="40" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-10 w-10 rounded-full" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fannabelle-veed.8957a302.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fannabelle-veed.8957a302.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fannabelle-veed.8957a302.png&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col gap-0.5"><p class="text-xs text-neutral-600">Annabelle Rose</p><p class="font-semibold leading-none text-neutral-900">Account Executive</p><p class="text-sm text-neutral-700">VEED.IO</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto my-20 flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col-reverse gap-8 md:flex-row-reverse"><div class="flex-1 basis-1/2 lg:pl-8"><img alt="Verifying email addresses" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="700" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-3xl" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fuvp-2.3d997090.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fuvp-2.3d997090.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fuvp-2.3d997090.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="flex flex-1 basis-1/2 flex-col md:items-start"><h2 class="text-pretty text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Data you can trust with near-<span class="bg-primary-200/35 px-1">zero bounces</span></h2><p class="mt-6 text-pretty text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-neutral-900">Don&#x27;t get trapped in spam. Our<!-- --> <a class="underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-black" href="/tools/email-verifier">email triple-verification</a> <!-- -->process checks each address twice - first advanced pattern matching and then through server validation &amp; OSINT analysis - ensuring market-leading delivery rates with. Finally, you can send cold emails with confidence!</p><div class="mt-6 flex flex-col items-start justify-start gap-x-3 gap-y-1 font-medium text-neutral-700 lg:flex-row"><div class="flex flex-row items-center justify-center gap-1"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Triple verification</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center justify-center gap-1"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Disposable email check</div></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto my-20 flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col-reverse gap-8 md:flex-row"><div class="flex-1 basis-1/2 lg:pr-8"><img alt="Bulk email finder and enrichment" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="700" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-3xl" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fuvp-3.b12e6e7a.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fuvp-3.b12e6e7a.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fuvp-3.b12e6e7a.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="flex flex-1 basis-1/2 flex-col md:items-start"><h2 class="text-pretty text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Find<!-- --> <span class="bg-primary-200/35 px-1">more valid emails</span> <!-- -->than alternative providers</h2><p class="mt-6 text-pretty text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-neutral-900">Enrich your lead lists with exclusive data that can&#x27;t be found by other competitor services. Getinbox will always<!-- --> <a class="underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-black" href="/tools/email-finder">find email addresses</a> <!-- -->for your most important prospects.</p><div class="mt-6 flex flex-col items-start justify-start gap-x-3 gap-y-1 font-medium text-neutral-700 lg:flex-row"><div class="flex flex-row items-center justify-center gap-1"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Superior quality</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center justify-center gap-1"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>Highest coverage</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="container my-20 max-w-6xl text-center"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl"><p class="mb-4 text-sm font-black uppercase text-primary-700">Scale your outreach</p><h2 class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-pretty text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-5xl">Direct contact information for every lead on your list</h2><p class="mt-6 text-pretty text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-neutral-900">Reach more targets while protecting your sender repuation. Don&#x27;t worry about spending time removing emojis, cleaning up capitalization, or fixing company names – Getinbox automatically cleans and formats your data.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center"><a class="cursor-pointer overflow-hidden relative appearance-none inline-flex gap-1.5 text-center items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-neutral-900 aria-disabled:pointer-events-none aria-disabled:opacity-50 aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-primary-700 text-white hover:bg-primary-500 mt-10 h-14 px-9 text-xl font-bold" href="/signup"><span>Find verified emails</span><span class="font-normal text-neutral-100">- it&#x27;s free!</span></a><div class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-x-3 gap-y-1 font-medium text-neutral-700 md:flex-row"><div class="flex flex-row items-center justify-center gap-1"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 text-green-500" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.2